Orbit read-only query frontend

src/query.pest is adapted from the openCypher 9 M23 EBNF grammar:
https://s3.amazonaws.com/artifacts.opencypher.org/M23/cypher.ebnf
SHA-256: adffaf25f8394e3276bf17c813596675d042f7e35058b7ea16583bc3c13c0554

Changes: translate selected productions to Pest, restrict query shapes and
expressions to Orbit compiler capabilities, restrict identifiers and arrows to
ASCII, and add implementation extensions for shortestPath pattern syntax,
node projections, date_trunc, and token predicates. This is not an official
openCypher grammar or a claim of full language conformance.

